From 684efa80bb34316785ae5501631e0b5450fa7c09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:11:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Themes: Manuscript, Manuscript Night and High Contrast

Manuscript is a theme for long writing, in the brand's own colours: warm
paper panels and a paler paper page, near-black ink text, the
proofreader's vermilion where something is chosen (menu selections,
check marks, the keyboard focus) and a vermilion wash on a chosen list
line, Prose Blue for links, on the ruled Manuscript wallpaper, in the
Prose frame. Manuscript Night is the same after dark: the ink ground
with chalk-coloured text and a lighter vermilion, on the dark Manuscript
wallpaper.

The two wallpapers are the brand's Manuscript designs (brand/ in main),
rendered again at 3840 x 2160 with the lockup corrected -- it had been
drawn twice, a few pixels apart, and carried the old kernel name -- and
the asterism made of three asterisks, as Georgia has no U+2042. They
ship in data/artwork beside the paper and ink ones.

High Contrast: black text on white everywhere, black selections with
white text, a blue keyboard focus, and the frame with glyph buttons at
the right, whose signs are the text colour, so nothing depends on
telling colours apart; the window in front has a black title bar, those
behind a white one with a black outline, on a white desktop with no
picture.

Verified in a guest from user copies of the files: all three apply, and
the desktop labels read at 18.0:1 on Manuscript's paper, 18.5:1 on
Manuscript Night's ink.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0091-themes-manuscript-manuscript-night-and-high-contrast.patch bbbf45bdec07d3fbf48f1611a033d15d3f8a545659b384eb5f6b1ddb085b0dcc
---
 build/jam/packages/Haiku                      |   4 +-
 build/jam/packages/ProsePortal                |   3 +-
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png     | Bin 0 -> 193756 bytes
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png    | Bin 0 -> 194084 bytes
 data/prose/themes/High Contrast.theme         |  55 ++++++++++++++++++
 data/prose/themes/Manuscript Night.theme      |  52 +++++++++++++++++
 data/prose/themes/Manuscript.theme            |  52 +++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png
 create mode 100644 data/prose/themes/High Contrast.theme
 create mode 100644 data/prose/themes/Manuscript Night.theme
 create mode 100644 data/prose/themes/Manuscript.theme

diff --git a/build/jam/packages/Haiku b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
index effbc06afa..dfe1061774 100644
--- a/build/jam/packages/Haiku
+++ b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
@@ -282,7 +282,9 @@ AddFilesToPackage boot first-login : $(firstLoginFiles) ;
 local logoArtwork =
 	"PROSE logo - paper on ink - big.png"
 	"PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png"
-	"PROSE wallpaper - paper light.png" ;
+	"PROSE wallpaper - paper light.png"
+	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png"
+	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png" ;
 SEARCH on $(logoArtwork) = [ FDirName $(HAIKU_TOP) data artwork ] ;
 AddFilesToPackage data artwork : $(logoArtwork) ;
 
diff --git a/build/jam/packages/ProsePortal b/build/jam/packages/ProsePortal
index ae591eb326..c0690e5f2d 100644
--- a/build/jam/packages/ProsePortal
+++ b/build/jam/packages/ProsePortal
@@ -21,7 +21,8 @@ AddFilesToPackage data launch : $(portalLaunch) ;
 AddFilesToPackage bin : prosetheme ;
 
 local proseThemes = "Prose Light.theme" "Prose Dark.theme" Classic.theme
-	Platinum.theme Win2k.theme NeXTSTEP.theme ;
+	Platinum.theme Win2k.theme NeXTSTEP.theme Manuscript.theme
+	"Manuscript Night.theme" "High Contrast.theme" ;
 proseThemes = $(proseThemes:G=prose-themes) ;
 SEARCH on $(proseThemes) = [ FDirName $(HAIKU_TOP) data prose themes ] ;
 AddFilesToPackage data prose themes : $(proseThemes) ;
diff --git a/data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png b/data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png
new file mode 100644
